{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>את אשר התעללתי (that which I made sport of).</b> By way of the plain sense (peshat): I made sport of them when I executed great vengeance upon them, in the manner of (Psalms 2:4): ״יושב בשמים ישחק ה׳ ילעג למו״." "<b>וידעתם כי אני ה׳ (and you shall know that I am YHWH).</b> For the hour and for the generations: for through this discipline that the Holy One, blessed be He, administered in Egypt, Israel will recognize for all generations and know His great name; and the nations of the world too will be chastised through them, will see and take admonition, in the manner of what is written concerning the Philistines when they detained the Ark of the Covenant among them (I Samuel 6:6): ״ולמה תכבדו את לבבכם כאשר כבדו מצרים ופרעה את לבם הלא כאשר התעלל בהם וישלחם וילכו״. <br><b>And it is possible to interpret</b> אשר התעללתי as being from the language of עלה (cause/first principle), for the deeds done in this world Scripture calls עלילות (causations), in the manner of (Psalms 105:1): ״הודיעו בעמים עלילותיו״, and it is written (I Samuel 2:3): ״ולו נתכנו עלילות״, and this is what Onkelos translated: ית נסין דעבדית במצרים, and so David said of the Holy One, blessed be He, (Psalms 66:5): ״נורא עלילה על בני אדם״, and all actions are called עלילות because all of them are drawn and emanated from the first עלה (Cause), and all created beings are עלולים (effects) before Him." "<b>And Scripture explains</b> that through His causations and wonders in Egypt He showed Himself to be the Cause, as is known, for through Egypt His divinity was made known in the world. From this the prophet said (Hosea 12:10): ״ואנכי ה׳ אלהיך המעלך מארץ מצרים״ — He says: from the land of Egypt the created beings began to know Me, and My name became known among the nations because I altered the natural order through renowned miracles." "<b>And by way of the Midrash</b> — את אשר התעללתי: the Holy One, blessed be He, said: just as they made sport of My vineyard, so do I make sport of them out of the world."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:57:27.655753744Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}